      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am deeply sorry to hear that you feel your life's work and the drive behind it have been so abruptly cut off. While the feeling that the end of your journey is a \"mathematical certainty\" is a heavy and painful reality to face, please remember that you are not your company or the specific assets you built. The relationships, the leadership you developed, and the expertise you mastered do not disappear with the infrastructure; they take you to the next challenge. It is natural to feel a sense of entropy in such a sudden abdication of control, but your life is not finally over when you feel it end.",
